  "description": "The R8 Revolver delivers a highly accurate and powerful round at the expense of a lengthy trigger-pull. Firing rapidly by fanning the hammer may be the best option when point-blank stopping power is required. It has been painted using a spider web-patterned hydrographic over a red base coat and finished with a semi-gloss topcoat.\\n\\n<i>Be careful where you walk, you never know where the web is spread</i>",
